1
00:00:00,852 --> 00:00:02,852
Hey, you guys wanna go
on a real live quest?

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,400
(Sheldon:)Outside? I just made cocoa.

3
00:00:06,607 --> 00:00:07,897
Oh, come on, it'll be fun.

4
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:09,447
(Howard:)What is it?

5
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:11,860
(Leonard:)Do you guys remember
Penny's ex-boyfriend Kurt?

6
00:00:15,283 --> 00:00:16,283
(Leonard:)Yeah, that's him.

7
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:20,950
Uh, it turns out he owes Penny a lot
of money and I'm gonna go get it from him.

8
00:00:21,122 --> 00:00:22,792
Who's with me?

9
00:00:26,544 --> 00:00:28,374
(Howard:)Ooh, double sixes.

10
00:00:28,546 --> 00:00:31,046
(Penny:)Really?
You're just gonna let me go by myself?

11
00:00:31,215 --> 00:00:33,635
(Raj:)Oh, cool, I got a sword.

12
00:00:33,801 --> 00:00:35,551
(Leonard:)I could use some help.

13
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,140
(Howard:)Here.

14
00:00:38,931 --> 00:00:40,351
(Leonard:)You guys are unbelievable.

15
00:00:40,516 --> 00:00:43,686
(Leonard:)You play a game to simulate adventure,
but when there's adventure...

16
00:00:43,853 --> 00:00:45,983
(Leonard:)...in the real world you just wimp out.

17
00:00:46,147 --> 00:00:49,237
(Sheldon:)Leonard, do you not recall the last time
we visited this gentleman?

18
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,940
(Sheldon:)We returned home without pants.

19
00:00:53,613 --> 00:00:55,493
(Leonard:)- I do.
- Are you sure?

20
00:00:55,656 --> 00:00:57,906
(Sheldon:)Because your proposal suggests
that you don't.

21
00:00:58,284 --> 00:00:59,414
(Leonard:)I'm not afraid of him.

